From u4b16035cff9b0f8a at groups.google.com  Fri Jun 27 15:40:09 2014
From: u4b16035cff9b0f8a at groups.google.com (Erica Rettig)
Date: Fri, 27 Jun 2014 15:40:09 +0000
Subject: Re: [D-RUG]: no acceptable C compiler found in $PATH
